msgstr "Resum del tema"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:10
msgid ""
"The [full topic synthesis](aggregation-and-calculation-services.md) maps "
"source resolvers that turn profile facts, transactions, invoices, "
"registers and prior filings into values for a selected Modelo revision. A"
" typed source mesh keeps scalar amounts, rows, relations, diagnostics and"
" provenance distinct; exclusive merge rejects duplicate ownership. IVA "
"uses dated admission, EUR and payment evidence, prorrata and invoice "
"cross-checks. Renta has distinct annual, cumulative quarterly and "
"agrarian routes; withholding recognition feeds periodic captures and "
"annual views. OSS/IOSS, M720, inventory and counterpart previews are "
"narrower capabilities with their own source and provenance limits. An "
"aggregate or parser-supported input alone does not establish a filing-"
"grade calculation. Source mesh "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`) IVA admission "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) Renta source "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_income_ledger.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md), [035](../articles/035-renta-ledgers-withholding-rollups-"
"and-aggregation-service.md), [036](../articles/036-source-resolution-"
"contracts-and-withholding-capture.md))"
msgstr ""
"La [síntesi completa del tema](aggregation-and-calculation-services.md) "
"descriu els resolutors de fonts que converteixen dades del perfil, "
"transaccions, factures, registres i presentacions anteriors en valors per"
" a una revisió seleccionada de Modelo. Una xarxa de fonts tipada manté "
"diferenciats els imports escalars, les files, les relacions, els "
"diagnòstics i la procedència; la fusió exclusiva rebutja la titularitat "
"duplicada. L’IVA utilitza admissió datada, EUR i evidències de pagament, "
"prorrata i comprovacions creuades de factures. La renda té vies "
"diferenciades anuals, trimestrals acumulatives i agràries; el "
"reconeixement de retencions alimenta les captures periòdiques i les "
"vistes anuals. OSS/IOSS, M720, inventari i previsualitzacions de "
"contraparts són capacitats més delimitades amb els seus propis límits de "
"fonts i procedència. Un agregat o una entrada admesa per un analitzador "
"no estableixen per si sols un càlcul apte per a la presentació. Xarxa de "
"fonts (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`) Admissió "
"d’IVA (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) Font de"
" renda (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_income_ledger.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md), [035](../articles/035-renta-ledgers-withholding-rollups-"
"and-aggregation-service.md), [036](../articles/036-source-resolution-"
"contracts-and-withholding-capture.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:12
msgid ""
"Cross-period prefill requires source observations stamped for the "
"caller's pinned authority; a separate clean-state gate checks filing "
"revision, member coverage, verification, and official evidence. M303 IVA "
"carry uses a canonical disposition envelope and atomic "
"observation/history co-commit contract; an unknown opening balance stays "
"unresolved for annual M390. Withholding mutation uses baseline-guarded "
"replacement and exact-command replay. These are strong local controls, "
"while storage atomicity and authority accuracy depend on adapters and "
"bundled data. Clean-state gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/cross_period_clean_state.py`) M303"
" co-commit "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/iva_compensation_history.py`) "
"Withholding mutation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/withholding_observation_service.py`)"
" ([033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md), [041](../articles/041-filing-carries-cross-period-clean-"
"state-and-calculation-advisories.md), [042](../articles/042-iva-"
"compensation-m303-evidence-and-annual-handoffs.md), [043](../articles/043"
"-prorrata-settlement-relation-prefill-and-row-set-reconstruction.md))"
msgstr ""
"L’emplenament previ entre períodes exigeix observacions de font "
"segellades per a l’autoritat fixada del cridador; un control separat "
"d’estat net comprova la revisió de presentació, la cobertura de membres, "
"la verificació i l’evidència oficial. L’arrossegament d’IVA de M303 "
"utilitza un embolcall canònic de disposició i un contracte de confirmació"
" conjunta atòmica d’observació i historial; un saldo inicial desconegut "
"continua sense resoldre per a l’M390 anual. La mutació de retencions "
"utilitza substitució protegida per una base de referència i reproducció "
"de l’ordre exacta. Són controls locals sòlids, mentre que l’atomicitat de"
" l’emmagatzematge i l’exactitud de l’autoritat depenen dels adaptadors i "
"de les dades incloses. Control d’estat net "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/cross_period_clean_state.py`) "
"Confirmació conjunta de M303 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/iva_compensation_history.py`) "
"Mutació de retencions "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/withholding_observation_service.py`)"
" ([033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md), [041](../articles/041-filing-carries-cross-period-clean-"
"state-and-calculation-advisories.md), [042](../articles/042-iva-"
"compensation-m303-evidence-and-annual-handoffs.md), [043](../articles/043"
"-prorrata-settlement-relation-prefill-and-row-set-reconstruction.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:14
msgid ""
"The highest-priority scoped findings are a raw foreign-currency versus "
"EUR comparison in an invoice silence-guard branch and filing-snapshot "
"fingerprints that omit calculation-relevant IVA fields. Authority-"
"generation reopening in M303 transition and withholding helpers matters "
"if historical generations are reachable; fractional integer/date coercion"
" in detail-row assembly needs upstream admission checks. These are code-"
"level findings and conditional impacts, not confirmed production filing "
"errors. Currency comparison "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_modelo_bindings_invoice_iva_refusal.py`)"
" Snapshot fields "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/ledger_filing_snapshot.py`) "
"Generation reopening "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/m303_arrivals.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md), [036](../articles/036-source-resolution-contracts-and-"
"withholding-capture.md))"
msgstr ""
"Les conclusions delimitades de màxima prioritat són una comparació de "
"divisa estrangera bruta amb EUR en una branca del control contra el "
"silenci de factures i unes empremtes d’instantània de presentació que "
"ometen camps d’IVA rellevants per al càlcul. La reobertura de generació "
"d’autoritat en la transició de M303 i en les funcions auxiliars de "
"retencions importa si les generacions històriques són accessibles; la "
"conversió de fraccions a enters i dates en el muntatge de files de detall"
" necessita comprovacions d’admissió prèvies. Són conclusions del codi i "
"impactes condicionals, no errors de presentació confirmats en producció. "
"Comparació de divises "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_modelo_bindings_invoice_iva_refusal.py`)"
" Camps d’instantània "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/ledger_filing_snapshot.py`) "
"Reobertura de generació "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/m303_arrivals.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md), [036](../articles/036-source-resolution-contracts-and-"
"withholding-capture.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:20
msgid ""
"This layer turns profile facts, bank transactions, invoices, registers, "
"prior declarations, and operator evidence into typed source observations "
"for a selected Modelo revision. A source resolver receives a bucket, "
"filing period, revision, and caller-held authority operation, and returns"
" values, rows, diagnostics, and provenance through separate channels. "
"Exclusive merging rejects competing owners of a binding; a precedence "
"merge is reserved for declared override tiers. A terminal-origin audit "
"compares a binding's expected origin with actual lineage but leaves "
"enforcement to later verification. This architecture makes an amount's "
"source inspectable without asserting that every possible Modelo or tax "
"rule is implemented. Source mesh "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`) Merge policy "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_resolution_operations.py`) "
"Origin audit "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/terminal_origin_audit.py`) "
"([036](../articles/036-source-resolution-contracts-and-withholding-"
"capture.md))"
msgstr ""
"Aquesta capa converteix dades del perfil, transaccions bancàries, "
"factures, registres, declaracions anteriors i evidències de l’operador en"
" observacions de font tipades per a una revisió seleccionada de Modelo. "
"Un resolutor de fonts rep un contenidor, un període de presentació, una "
"revisió i una operació d’autoritat mantinguda pel cridador, i retorna "
"valors, files, diagnòstics i procedència per canals separats. La fusió "
"exclusiva rebutja propietaris competidors d’una vinculació; una fusió per"
" precedència es reserva als nivells declarats de substitució. Una "
"auditoria d’origen terminal compara l’origen esperat d’una vinculació amb"
" el llinatge real, però deixa l’aplicació dels controls a una verificació"
" posterior. Aquesta arquitectura permet inspeccionar la font d’un import "
"sense afirmar que tots els possibles Modelo o regles tributàries estiguin"
" implementats. Xarxa de fonts "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`) Política de fusió "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_resolution_operations.py`) "
"Auditoria d’origen "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/terminal_origin_audit.py`) "
"([036](../articles/036-source-resolution-contracts-and-withholding-"
"capture.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:22
msgid "Transaction and invoice evidence"
msgstr "Evidències de transaccions i factures"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:24
msgid ""
"The IVA classifier admits transactions through dated revision facts, "
"filing-period and direction gates, business share, measured "
"base/quota/rate, category, cash-accounting, and deduction identity. Valid"
" ordinary rows become settlement observations; cash-accounting rows split"
" by payment evidence and retain a later fallback date for unpaid "
"remainder. The repository-backed path checks bucket scope, reads the "
"relevant date partition and named investment acquisition rows, then "
"applies general, special, or sectorized prorrata to deductible input "
"quota while leaving bases and output quota unchanged. Readiness reuses "
"admission gates, though it does not calculate values. Invoice IVA "
"screening converts amounts to EUR, preserves base-only lines, checks "
"category/counterparty and deduction links, and compares invoice-derived "
"output to ledger bindings. A missing or unreadable invoice catalogue is a"
" degraded source, not evidence of no invoices. IVA admission "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) Cash split "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) Prorrata "
"bindings (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/iva_ledger.py`) Invoice "
"screen "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_modelo_bindings_invoice_iva.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md))"
msgstr ""
"El classificador d’IVA admet transaccions mitjançant dades de revisió "
"datades, controls de període de presentació i direcció, proporció "
"empresarial, base, quota i tipus mesurats, categoria, criteri de caixa i "
"identitat de deducció. Les files ordinàries vàlides esdevenen "
"observacions de liquidació; les files de criteri de caixa es divideixen "
"segons les evidències de pagament i conserven una data alternativa "
"posterior per al romanent impagat. La via basada en repositoris comprova "
"l’àmbit del contenidor, llegeix la partició de dates pertinent i les "
"files amb nom d’adquisició d’inversions, i després aplica prorrata "
"general, especial o sectoritzada a la quota suportada deduïble, deixant "
"intactes les bases i la quota repercutida. La preparació reutilitza els "
"controls d’admissió, tot i que no calcula valors. El filtratge d’IVA de "
"factures converteix imports a EUR, conserva les línies només de base, "
"comprova la categoria, la contrapart i els enllaços de deducció, i "
"compara la sortida derivada de factures amb les vinculacions del llibre "
"major. Un catàleg de factures absent o il·legible és una font degradada, "
"no una evidència que no hi hagi factures. Admissió d’IVA "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) Divisió per "
"caixa (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`) "
"Vinculacions de prorrata "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/iva_ledger.py`) Filtratge de "
"factures "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_modelo_bindings_invoice_iva.py`) "
"([031](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-evidence.md),"
" [033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:26
msgid ""
"Renta sources intentionally differ by period and model. Modelo 130 uses a"
" cumulative quarter-to-date window, Modelo 100 an annual one, and Modelo "
"131 narrows to selected agrarian categories. An admitted bank receipt can"
" still contribute cash when invoice-base evidence fails, with a "
"`CASH_FALLBACK` marker and advisory rather than pretending cash equals "
"gross invoice income. Annual deductible-expense rules require reviewed "
"business classification where quarterly rules may accept an activity "
"marker, and reciprocal purchase-invoice linkage is checked before the "
"invoice's base and IVA enrich the expense. Activity-asset acquisitions "
"and depreciation claims have their own ownership route to avoid ordinary-"
"expense double counting. Modelo 210 requires a durable official income-"
"code classification; impatriate source jurisdiction and category come "
"from governed facts. These are calculation source routes, not official "
"export or submission capabilities. Income observation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_income_ledger.py`) Expense "
"and invoice link (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_ledger.py`) "
"Asset ownership "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/modelo_bindings.py`) IRNR source "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/irnr_income_ledger.py`) "
"([032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md), [035](../articles/035-renta-ledgers-withholding-rollups-"
"and-aggregation-service.md))"
msgstr ""
"Les fonts de renda difereixen intencionadament segons el període i el "
"model. Modelo 130 utilitza una finestra acumulada fins al trimestre, "
"Modelo 100 una d’anual i Modelo 131 es limita a categories agràries "
"seleccionades. Un cobrament bancari admès encara pot aportar caixa quan "
"falla l’evidència de base de factura, amb un marcador `CASH_FALLBACK` i "
"un avís en lloc de fingir que la caixa equival als ingressos bruts de la "
"factura. Les regles anuals de despeses deduïbles exigeixen una "
"classificació empresarial revisada allà on les trimestrals poden acceptar"
" un marcador d’activitat, i es comprova la vinculació recíproca de la "
"factura de compra abans que la base i l’IVA de la factura enriqueixin la "
"despesa. Les adquisicions d’actius d’activitat i les sol·licituds "
"d’amortització tenen la seva pròpia via de titularitat per evitar el "
"doble còmput com a despesa ordinària. Modelo 210 exigeix una "
"classificació duradora del codi oficial de renda; la jurisdicció i la "
"categoria de la font d’impatriats provenen de dades governades. Són vies "
"de fonts de càlcul, no capacitats d’exportació oficial o de presentació. "
"Observació d’ingressos "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_income_ledger.py`) Despesa i "
"enllaç de factura (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/renta_ledger.py`)"
" Titularitat d’actius "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/modelo_bindings.py`) Font IRNR "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/irnr_income_ledger.py`) "
"([032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md), [035](../articles/035-renta-ledgers-withholding-rollups-"
"and-aggregation-service.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:28
msgid ""
"Other specialized routes include OSS/IOSS issued-invoice candidates for "
"Modelo 369, with destination/rate verification and EUR conversion; "
"foreign-asset observations for Modelo 720, with threshold grouping based "
"on dated registry blocks; inventory valuations that require a sealed "
"activity ledger; and counterpart M347/M349 grouping. The M347/M349 "
"aggregation service is an operator preview, distinct from the live "
"calculation source mesh. M720 raw aggregate observations intentionally "
"lack a persisted asset identity and thus do not by themselves prove "
"filing-grade provenance; validated worksheet rows can provide row "
"identities. Invoice devengo uses a single date or issue-date proxy, so "
"partial advance schedules cannot be expressed by that model. Direction-"
"only invoice-kind mapping cannot faithfully represent a refunded "
"purchase. OSS candidates "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/oss_ioss.py`) M720 threshold "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/foreign_assets.py`) Inventory "
"source (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/inventory.py`) Counterpart "
"preview (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/counterpart.py`) Devengo "
"limit (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/invoice_devengo.py`) "
"([032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md))"
msgstr ""
"Altres vies especialitzades inclouen candidats de factures emeses "
"OSS/IOSS per a Modelo 369, amb verificació de destinació i tipus i "
"conversió a EUR; observacions d’actius estrangers per a Modelo 720, amb "
"agrupació per llindars basada en blocs datats del registre; valoracions "
"d’inventari que exigeixen un llibre d’activitat segellat; i agrupació de "
"contraparts M347/M349. El servei d’agregació M347/M349 és una "
"previsualització per a l’operador, diferenciada de la xarxa de fonts de "
"càlcul activa. Les observacions agregades brutes de M720 no tenen "
"intencionadament una identitat d’actiu persistida i, per tant, no "
"demostren per si mateixes una procedència apta per a la presentació; les "
"files validades del full de treball poden proporcionar identitats de "
"fila. La meritació de factures utilitza una sola data o la data d’emissió"
" com a aproximació, de manera que aquest model no pot expressar "
"calendaris de bestretes parcials. La correspondència del tipus de factura"
" basada només en la direcció no pot representar fidelment una compra "
"reemborsada. Candidats OSS "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/oss_ioss.py`) Llindar M720 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/foreign_assets.py`) Font "
"d’inventari (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/inventory.py`) "
"Previsualització de contraparts "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/counterpart.py`) Límit de meritació"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/invoice_devengo.py`) "
"([032](../articles/032-aggregation-sources-evidence-and-withholding-"
"projections.md), [034](../articles/034-model-bindings-oss-ioss-and-renta-"
"expenses.md))"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:30
msgid "Withholding and cross-period state"
msgstr "Retencions i estat entre períodes"

#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:32
msgid ""
"Withholding capture derives recognition from payment or exigibility "
"evidence, routes supported work, professional, urban-rent, and ordinary "
"movable-capital items to 111/115/123, then stores per-perceptor "
"observations through an append/replace/clear service. Replay requires an "
"idempotency key with the same canonical command; replacements require the"
" current window baseline. Annual 190 and 193 are assembled from periodic "
"allocations, with 193 pending-payment rows using a generic recipient and "
"later settlements carrying an explicit unresolved payment-year authority "
"advisory. The path for ordinary capital into Modelo 123 explicitly "
"refuses a calculable window until its annual rent-count definition is "
"supported. A concrete repository must honor the atomic capture contract; "
"this layer does not prove storage transactions. Recognition "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/withholding_recognition.py`) "
"Mutation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/withholding_observation_service.py`)"
" Annual source "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/withholding_source.py`) Pending "
"phase "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/m193_phase_materialization.py`) "
"([033](../articles/033-iva-ledger-filing-drift-and-withholding-"
"arrivals.md), [035](../articles/035-renta-ledgers-withholding-rollups-"
"and-aggregation-service.md), [036](../articles/036-source-resolution-"
"contracts-and-withholding-capture.md))"
msgstr ""
"La captura de retencions deriva el reconeixement de les evidències de "
"pagament o exigibilitat, encamina els elements admesos de treball, "
"professionals, lloguer urbà i capital mobiliari ordinari a 111/115/123, i"
" després emmagatzema observacions per perceptor mitjançant un servei "
"d’afegir, substituir o esborrar. La reproducció exigeix una clau "
"d’idempotència amb la mateixa ordre canònica; les substitucions exigeixen"
" la base de referència actual de la finestra. Els anuals 190 i 193 es "
"munten a partir d’assignacions periòdiques, amb files de pagament pendent"
" de 193 que utilitzen un destinatari genèric i liquidacions posteriors "
"que porten un avís explícit d’autoritat no resolta de l’any de pagament. "
"La via de capital ordinari cap a Modelo 123 refusa explícitament una "
"finestra calculable fins que s’admeti la definició del recompte anual de "
"rendes. Un repositori concret ha de respectar el contracte de captura "
"atòmica; aquesta capa no demostra les transaccions d’emmagatzematge. "
