#: ../../technical/topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md:38
msgid ""
"Strong controls are source-specific typed refusals, exact bucket and "
"revision checks, dated authority selection, separately marked missing and"
" empty states, provenance-bearing folds, and later filing-grade gates. "
"Financial and tax-identity evidence still traverses this layer and needs "
"outer encrypted storage and disclosure controls. Several local findings "
"deserve focused verification. The invoice silence guard compares raw "
"foreign-currency withholding quota with EUR ledger values in one branch; "
"a multi-transaction linked-authority helper can ignore incomplete linked "
"entries. The filing snapshot fingerprints omit IVA inputs such as "
"operation date, cash payments, and VAT-identification state, so a changed"
" calculation-relevant fact may escape its drift comparison. M303 "
"transition and withholding source helpers reopen default authority "
"despite a pinned operation; impact depends on reachable historical "
"generations. Row-set reconstruction truncates fractional integer cells "
"and defaults malformed dates to year end unless upstream admission "
"forbids them. Currency branch "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_modelo_bindings_invoice_iva_refusal.py`)"
